WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:02.760
<b><v>Narrator:</v></b> 1, B

00:00:05.442 --> 00:00:08.503
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Hi. I’m just leaving the house now.

00:00:11.037 --> 00:00:13.719
<v><b>Lina:</b></v> Me too. I’m walking to the bus stop.

00:00:14.035 --> 00:00:15.473
Are you getting the bus too?

00:00:17.755 --> 00:00:19.755
<b><v>Narrator:</v></b> 2, D

00:00:22.043 --> 00:00:26.760
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> No, I’m not. I’m walking. See you in 20 minutes?

00:00:29.136 --> 00:00:30.880
<v><b>Lina:</b></v> OK. See you then.

00:00:33.057 --> 00:00:35.455
<b><v>Narrator:</v></b> 3, C

00:00:38.019 --> 00:00:42.468
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> Where are you? I’m at the cinema, but I can’t see you.

00:00:42.649 --> 00:00:44.177
I’m waiting outside.

00:00:45.999 --> 00:00:50.829
<v><b>Lina:</b></v> Sorry, we’re in a lot of traffic. There in five minutes.

00:00:52.735 --> 00:00:54.735
<v><b>Narrator:</v></b> 4, A

00:00:56.594 --> 00:00:59.582
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> It’s really cold outside. I’m going in.

00:01:01.476 --> 00:01:03.377
<v><b>Lina:</b></v> I’m arriving at the cinema now.

00:01:03.388 --> 00:01:04.642
Where are you?

00:01:06.561 --> 00:01:08.707
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5, E

00:01:10.673 --> 00:01:15.106
<v><b>Mike:</b></v> I’m standing near the box office. I’m wearing a black jacket.

00:01:15.107 --> 00:01:16.569
Can you see me?

00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:21.189
<v><b>Lina:</b></v> Yes, I can! Can you see me?

00:01:21.474 --> 00:01:23.248
I’m walking towards you now!